s com duplo acionamento.\nTomadas USB, WI-FI, vagas para carros elétricos e controle de acesso por RFID.\n\nLocalização estratégica em uma região de alta valorização, assegurando um excelente retorno para seu investimento.\n\nAs imagens são meramente ilustrativas.","fotos":["https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/696176d6983221c7a75ddc38/pilar-homes-images-watermark/4b3f4710-ece1-457c-9fbd-08ef0347c7ce.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/696176d6983221c7a75ddc38/pilar-homes-images-watermark/8a44b3c1-cf08-4e88-b0b2-5ce966f58ffb.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/696176d6983221c7a75ddc38/pilar-homes-images-watermark/1c09cc47-21d2-4e7f-ad68-8c96ddeb464c.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/696176d6983221c7a75ddc38/pilar-homes-images-watermark/67d12888-bb14-40ba-8849-61539b76a230.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/696176d6983221c7a75ddc38/pilar-homes-images-watermark/a3f7f1e2-bfe8-429f-bbd3-6548106086d6.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/696176d6983221c7a75ddc38/pilar-homes-images-watermark/98124237-4fec-497f-9833-ec0326eb9793.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/696176d6983221c7a75ddc38/pilar-homes-images-watermark/12dc3330-2a32-4fd8-acc3-60346f9b2eb7.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/696176d6983221c7a75ddc38/pilar-homes-images-watermark/cbca2a4a-9a66-4b1c-9700-68f6d52a7f87.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/696176d6983221c7a75ddc38/pilar-homes-images-watermark/72224a6e-7274-46f8-ae1a-a2bb35d349f9.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/696176d6983221c7a75ddc38/pilar-homes-images-watermark/674b1d4e-1aca-4289-918e-88c59da8c465.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/696176d6983221c7a75ddc38/pilar-homes-images-watermark/18d83df6-7193-4e55-a5d2-85787e8eb922.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/696176d6983221c7a75ddc38/pilar-hom